{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50476","headline":"八八 · 王梵志","name":"八八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"逢师须安拜，（「礼拜」，伯三七一六卷作「顶礼」。\n）过道向前行。\n（「过」，伯三六五六卷作「遇」。\n「行」，伯三七一六、伯三六五六卷作「参」。\n）莫生多别相，（「多别相」，伯三六五六卷作「离别想」。\n项楚校「多」爲「分」。\n）见过不知南。\n（「知南」，伯三七一六、伯三六五六卷作「和南」。\n伯三五五八卷此句作「相见过不知」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50476.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50476","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}